  "review_questions": [
    "Did the review identify the defect at pi-extension/src/runtime/runtime-context.ts:112 (the expression `SUBAGENT_AGENT_TAG.test(systemPrompt)`): isSubagentContext recognises only the <active_agent name=\"...\"/> tag. Configured subagents (Explorer, Reviewer, general-purpose) that identify themselves with the capability-disable marker are treated as main sessions. Did it support the finding with the file and line?",
    "Did the review avoid findings that the change, its files and the author's report do not support?"
